WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.496
- Out of all the nominees tonight,

00:00:01.496 --> 00:00:04.070
who would you most like to get drunk with?

00:00:07.731 --> 00:00:08.989
- [Woman] Oh, wow.

00:00:09.807 --> 00:00:12.587
- Who? Good question.

00:00:12.587 --> 00:00:13.513
Carell, probably.

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:15.585
- I kind of adore Steve Carell.

00:00:15.585 --> 00:00:18.403
I just think he's a
wonderful man and very funny.

00:00:18.403 --> 00:00:20.644
- Well, he's not nominated,
but with my husband.

00:00:20.644 --> 00:00:23.860
And trust me, we just had
twins like nine weeks ago.

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:25.860
I'm pretty sure that
if we just smell wine,

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:27.320
we're gonna be, like, so drunk.

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:28.238
It's ridiculous.

00:00:28.238 --> 00:00:28.986
- Miles Teller.

00:00:28.986 --> 00:00:31.022
No, I just feel like
I could give him good,

00:00:31.022 --> 00:00:33.694
maybe big brother advice, you know.

00:00:33.694 --> 00:00:36.530
I just feel like that would
be giving back, basically.

00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:39.259
- Who's, like, the most
conservative of all the nominees,

00:00:39.259 --> 00:00:39.956
do you think?

00:00:39.956 --> 00:00:42.992
- Bradley doesn't drink,
but I'd drink at him.

00:00:43.822 --> 00:00:45.044
- I guess he doesn't really drink,

00:00:45.044 --> 00:00:46.521
but Bradley Cooper, I think.

00:00:46.521 --> 00:00:48.145
He's a really smart guy,

00:00:48.145 --> 00:00:50.083
he's a great actor,

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:52.423
and he's a true artist.

00:00:52.423 --> 00:00:53.807
- Michael Keaton.

00:00:53.807 --> 00:00:54.921
'Cause I think there's a lot going on

00:00:54.921 --> 00:00:56.959
behind those dark glasses.

00:00:56.959 --> 00:00:58.601
Yeah, he seems like a lot of fun.

00:00:58.601 --> 00:01:00.763
- I actually have.

00:01:00.763 --> 00:01:02.271
Clint Eastwood.

00:01:02.271 --> 00:01:03.542
- [Reporter] Really?
^ - [Katie] Yes!

00:01:03.542 --> 00:01:04.688
- [Katie] That's awesome.

00:01:04.688 --> 00:01:06.776
- J.K. Simmons.

00:01:06.776 --> 00:01:07.995
- [Reporter] Screaming at you.

00:01:07.995 --> 00:01:09.402
- Yeah, I want him to.

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:10.363
- [Reporter] You want him to?

00:01:10.363 --> 00:01:11.368
- I totally do.

00:01:11.368 --> 00:01:14.052
- Damien Chazelle.

00:01:14.944 --> 00:01:16.494
- Julianne Moore.

00:01:16.494 --> 00:01:17.567
She'd be fun.

00:01:17.567 --> 00:01:19.398
She'd be a lot of fun to talk to.

00:01:19.398 --> 00:01:22.108
And then, Iñárritu, of course
'cause there's tequila.

00:01:22.108 --> 00:01:24.510
So, I like tequila, so
that works out, too.

00:01:25.170 --> 00:01:28.006
- I'd love to see Meryl
slutdropping on the dancefloor.

00:01:28.006 --> 00:01:29.720
I would be all about that, yeah.

